# Runtime files MaxiCrawler creates in the working directory it is run from.
# The paths mirror the defaults in maxicrawler.config.settings; a database can
# hold the URLs of everything you have crawled, so it must not be committed by
# accident. /library/ is anchored on purpose -- unanchored it would also match
# the tracked package src/maxicrawler/library/.
/maxicrawler.toml
/library/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
